# armour/shared/pauldron_shard3_l: the medium SHARD pauldron on the left shoulder (shard.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# knapped glass: two angular shards rising up and out of the plate along a dark crease, a V between them; the
# facet that faces the light lit, its partner dark (KNAPPED, obsidian).
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the shards' foot, G the lit facet's glint, N the creases, P the facets.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The rest views repeat as `when shoulder-shard` overlays: the shape's own drawing, which the body's cut skips.
use person
role pauldron shard.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

